CV Make Licensing Summary
=========================

The CV Make project is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
except where explicitly stated otherwise in individual source files or
subdirectories.

1. Main Source Code & Build Automation
--------------------------------------
Unless otherwise annotated, all source code (Python preprocessor, wrapper
scripts, CI/CD pipelines, and project configuration files) is provided under:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
    Full text available at: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

2. Documentation & Specifications
---------------------------------
All technical documentation, specifications, and architecture manuals located
in the docs/ directory are provided under:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

3. Default Stylesheets & Layout Assets
--------------------------------------
Default CSS stylesheets and template layouts located in src/styles/
are provided under:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

4. Example CVs & Sample Assets
------------------------------
All sample CV templates, generated demonstration PDF documents, and accompanying
sample portrait photography located in the examples/ directory are dedicated
to the public domain under the Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal dedication:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
    Full text available at: LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt

5. Third-Party Components & Attributions
----------------------------------------
This project utilizes external open-source packages, runtime libraries, and
system fonts. For detailed copyright notices, attribution statements, and
licensing requirements of bundled or referenced third-party components,
please refer to:

    NOTICE (and /usr/share/doc/ inside the runtime container)

6. Standard REUSE Compliance
----------------------------
Each individual file in this repository contains SPDX license and copyright
tags in its header comments or is mapped via REUSE.toml configuration.
Full text files for all applicable licenses (Apache-2.0, CC0-1.0) are
maintained in the:

    LICENSES/

directory in accordance with the REUSE Specification (v3.3).

